      "value": "<p><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">色彩龙起源</span></em></strong>。你的血脉可追溯到某<span class=\"GramE\">只色彩</span>龙身上，这赋予<span class=\"GramE\">你特殊</span>的魔法亲和。从色彩龙血脉表格中选择一项，这将决定<span class=\"GramE\">你其他</span>特性的伤害类型。<span><br></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">色彩龙血脉</span></strong><span><br></span>龙种<span>   </span>伤害类型<span><br></span>黑<span>       </span>强酸<span><br></span>蓝<span>       </span>闪电<span><br></span>绿<span>       </span>毒素<span><br></span>红<span>       </span>火焰<span><br></span>白<span>       </span>寒冷<span><br></span></p>",
